<p align="center"><b><font color="#FFFFFF" style="font-size: 60pt">Skydog Sports</font></b></p>
<p align="center"><font size="7" color="#FFFFFF">Finger Lakes, New York, 2007</font></p>

<p align="center"><font color="#FFFFFF" style="font-size: 16pt">Stories at the 
Bottom of Page</font></p>

<p align="center"><font color="#FFFFFF" style="font-size: 16pt">If you can help 
with some of the captions for the photos below, Please let me know</font></p>

<p align="center"><font size="4" color="#FFFFFF">
<a href="mailto:info@skydogsports.com"><font color="#FFFF00">Send Mail - Click Here</font></a></font></p>

<p align="center"><font color="#FFFFFF" size="6">October 18, 2007</font></p>

<p align="center"><font size="4" color="#FFFFFF">Italy Valley, New York</font></p>

<div align="center">
  <center>
  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="1" width="400">
    <tr>
      <td width="100%">
      <div align="center">
